            },
            {
              "card": "R3a8ec12bc38f",
              "field": "gap"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "经销模式把终端需求传到哪里？",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "公司以榨菜、下饭菜、泡菜及酱类等佐餐产品满足家庭与餐饮需求。2025年报物理14页披露经销为主、电商补充；订单经过生产与交付形成收入，终端动销和经销库存还需要另一组观察。",
          "anchors": [
            {
              "card": "R09e06cc7c1a8",
              "field": "claim"
            },
            {
              "card": "R09e06cc7c1a8",
              "field": "evidence"
            },
            {
              "card": "R09e06cc7c1a8",
              "field": "mechanism"
            },
            {
              "card": "R09e06cc7c1a8",
              "field": "alternative"
            },
            {
              "card": "R09e06cc7c1a8",
              "field": "variables"
            },
            {
              "card": "R09e06cc7c1a8",
              "field": "invalidate"
            },
            {
              "card": "R09e06cc7c1a8",
              "field": "gap"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "青菜头采购、腌制加工、包装、渠道和品牌费用，以及基地建设，共同决定一笔销售最终留下的利润和现金。收入恢复的质量取决于实际净价、产品组合及回款，固定SKU提价仍缺同口径价格资料。",
          "anchors": [
            {
              "card": "R09e06cc7c1a8",
              "field": "claim"
            },
            {
              "card": "R09e06cc7c1a8",
              "field": "evidence"
            },
            {
              "card": "R09e06cc7c1a8",
              "field": "mechanism"
            },
            {
              "card": "R09e06cc7c1a8",
              "field": "alternative"
            },
            {
              "card": "R09e06cc7c1a8",
              "field": "variables"
            },
            {
              "card": "R09e06cc7c1a8",
              "field": "invalidate"
            },
            {
              "card": "R09e06cc7c1a8",
              "field": "gap"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "收入、利润与现金呈现怎样的分化？",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "2025收入同比+1.88%，归母净利-3.92%、CFO-19.55%；2026前三季收入+3.45%，归母-8.78%，单季归母-11.79%。收入与利润的分化延续，费用、产品组合及投入效率是需要拆开的解释。",
          "anchors": [
            {
              "card": "R69074d027896",
              "field": "claim"
            },
            {
              "card": "R69074d027896",
              "field": "evidence"
            },
            {
              "card": "R69074d027896",
              "field": "mechanism"
            },
            {
              "card": "R69074d027896",
              "field": "alternative"
            },
            {
              "card": "R69074d027896",
              "field": "variables"
            },
            {
              "card": "R69074d027896",
              "field": "invalidate"
            },
            {
              "card": "R69074d027896",
              "field": "gap"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "2026H1收入+4.02%、归母-7.19%、CFO+195.21%。这段现金改善还需用应收、库存与经营应付余额桥接，才能区分回款、结算时点和需求变化。",
          "anchors": [
            {
              "card": "R69074d027896",
              "field": "claim"
            },
            {
              "card": "R69074d027896",
              "field": "evidence"
            },
            {
              "card": "R69074d027896",
              "field": "mechanism"
            },
            {
              "card": "R69074d027896",
              "field": "alternative"
            },
            {
              "card": "R69074d027896",
              "field": "variables"
            },
            {
              "card": "R69074d027896",
              "field": "invalidate"
            },
            {
              "card": "R69074d027896",
              "field": "gap"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "渠道效率改善与铺货扩张，怎样区分？",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "一种解释是真实消费和渠道效率恢复，先行营销与新基地投入可在爬坡后回收。另一种解释是铺货授信或组合迁移带来收入增长，费用、库存和闲置基地持续压低现金回报。",
          "anchors": [
            {
              "card": "R0b427d7dd7fe",
              "field": "claim"
            },
            {
              "card": "R0b427d7dd7fe",
              "field": "evidence"
            },
            {
              "card": "R0b427d7dd7fe",
              "field": "mechanism"
            },
            {
              "card": "R0b427d7dd7fe",
              "field": "alternative"
            },
            {
              "card": "R0b427d7dd7fe",
              "field": "variables"
            },
            {
              "card": "R0b427d7dd7fe",
              "field": "invalidate"
            },
            {
              "card": "R0b427d7dd7fe",
              "field": "gap"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "年底授信未收回、经销库存或退货上升且终端销量不改善，会推翻渠道效率改善的解释。同SKU净价未变而产品权重变化时，收入变化应转向组合解释。渠道的净贡献还要扣除专属广告、履约费用和资金占用。",
          "anchors": [
            {
              "card": "R0b427d7dd7fe",
              "field": "claim"
            },
            {
              "card": "R0b427d7dd7fe",
              "field": "evidence"
            },
            {
              "card": "R0b427d7dd7fe",
              "field": "mechanism"
            },
            {
              "card": "R0b427d7dd7fe",
              "field": "alternative"
            },
            {
              "card": "R0b427d7dd7fe",
              "field": "variables"
            },
            {
              "card": "R0b427d7dd7fe",
              "field": "invalidate"
            },
            {
              "card": "R0b427d7dd7fe",
              "field": "gap"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "未来收入和现金取决于哪些经营环节？",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "收入从同SKU净价与销量出发，分别计入渠道折扣与费用。青菜头采购和腌制库存经过加工、销售、授信到回款；新基地则经过建设、投产、利用率提升到现金回收。各环节的时间由本公司资料确定。",
          "anchors": [
            {
              "card": "R48ccbb2a4ad6",
              "field": "claim"
            },
            {
              "card": "R48ccbb2a4ad6",
              "field": "evidence"
            },
            {
              "card": "R48ccbb2a4ad6",
